  "releaseNotes": "- DataViewCollection now updates items when they change\n    - Updated Light Blue Theme Colors\n    - Fixed DataGrid Theming for cells that are both selected and pointer over\n    - Fixed max object limit when loading a private file\n    - Moved Chart SeriesLimit into ChartView\n    - Renamed ListProperty.Editable to IsEditable\n    - Renamed DeepClone() to TryDeepClone() and added non-nullable DeepClone() version\n    - Attributes\n      - Added Attribute Summary Documentation\n      - Renamed [Editing] to [EditColumn]\n      - Disabled [Unit] until it can be implemented\n      - Removed [Serialized] since it's no longer needed",
